  'gfr-estimate': {"title":"eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021): Serum Creatinine, Age & Sex","metaDesc":"Free eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021): enter the Serum Creatinine and Age and get a egfr of 107.3 mL/min.73m². Every step shown, nothing leaves your browser.","canonicalPath":"/health/gfr-estimate","cat":"health","catName":"Health","lsi":["egfr calculator ckd-epi 2021 creatinine kidney function gfr","egfr ckd epi formula","how to calculate egfr ckd","egfr formula"],"aeo":"<h2>What does the eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) do?</h2>\n<p>eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) works out the egfr from the Serum Creatinine, Age, and Sex, following standard Health conventions — the page defaults produce a egfr of 107.3 mL/min.73m².</p><ul><li><strong>Inputs:</strong> Serum Creatinine, Age, and Sex.</li><li><strong>Output:</strong> the egfr, plus the intermediate steps behind it.</li><li><strong>Method:</strong> the standard Health formula, evaluated entirely in your browser.</li></ul><h3>Quick answer</h3>\n<p>With the default inputs (serum creatinine of 1, age of 40, sex of 0), egfr calculator (ckd-epi 2021) returns a egfr of 107.3 mL/min.73m². Assumptions and limits are summarized below.</p><h2>How does the eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) work?</h2>\n<p>eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) computes the egfr directly from your inputs — the Serum Creatinine, Age, and Sex feed the formula. Nothing is uploaded: the math runs locally in your browser and the result appears as you type.</p>","desc":"<h2>How the eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) works</h2>\n<p>At its core, eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) takes the Serum Creatinine, Age, and Sex and evaluates the standard formula step by step, so the egfr can be checked rather than trusted on faith.</p>\n<h2>Using the eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021)</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Serum Creatinine</strong> — a core input egfr calculator (ckd-epi 2021) applies in the formula — keep the units consistent with the label.</li>\n<li><strong>Age</strong> — one of the values egfr calculator (ckd-epi 2021) builds the calculation from; the result reflects exactly what you type here.</li>\n<li><strong>Sex</strong> — used in the first stage of the calculation in egfr calculator (ckd-epi 2021), so entering it accurately matters more than any later refinement.</li>\n<li>Review the output. Beyond the headline egfr, egfr calculator (ckd-epi 2021) lists the intermediate steps — useful for catching a mistyped input.</li>\n<li>Iterate. Vary the inputs one at a time; the movement in the egfr shows which lever matters most for your egfr calculator (ckd-epi 2021) question.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>The formula behind the result</h2>\n<p>eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) lists every intermediate step in the result panel, so the derivation of the egfr can be checked line by line.</p>\n<p><strong>Worked example:</strong> with serum creatinine of 1, age of 40, sex of 0, egfr calculator (ckd-epi 2021) returns <strong>eGFR: 107.3 mL/min.73m²</strong>. The same run reports CKD stage G1 normal | Below 60 for 3+ months indicates chronic kidney disease — confirm with repeat testing.</p><p>The steps it follows:</p><ul><li>Formula (CKD-EPI 2021, race-free): 142 × (Scr/k)^a × 0.9938^age × 1.012 if female</li><li>Scr/k = 1 ÷ 0.9 = 1.1111</li><li>Raise to power a = -0.302 → 0.9687</li><li>Age factor 0.9938^40 = 0.7798</li></ul><p>Substitute your own values and the same steps produce your answer — that is the point of a calculator that shows its working.</p>\n<h2>Understanding the result</h2>\n<p>Interpret the egfr against the inputs that produced it — the same number from different inputs can mean different things, which is why eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) always shows the pairing.</p>\n<h2>Where it helps</h2>\n<p>Typical uses for eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) include egfr ckd epi planning, comparing scenarios side by side, and double-checking the egfr — anywhere the figure needs to be defensible rather than guessed.</p>\n<h2>Common mistakes</h2>\n<p>Rounding intermediate values by hand introduces error eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) does not have; it keeps full precision internally, so trust the displayed egfr over mental arithmetic.</p>\n<p><strong>Tip:</strong> If the egfr looks wrong, read the steps panel before re-entering anything; it usually shows exactly where the number in eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) departed from expectation.</p>\n<h2>Assumptions and limitations</h2>\n<p>The egfr is only as complete as the inputs: anything eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) does not ask for (fees, variability, local rules) sits outside the calculation.</p>\n<h2>Why use this calculator</h2>\n<p>Because the page doubles as documentation: eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) puts the formula, a worked example, and the assumptions right beside the calculator.</p>","faqs":[{"q":"What does the eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) calculate?","a":"eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) keeps the whole calculation in front of you — the Serum Creatinine, Age, and Sex, the formula, the intermediate steps, and a worked example you can reproduce line by line. Because the working is visible: eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) shows each operation behind the egfr in the steps panel, so you can verify the result instead of trusting a black box."},{"q":"How is the egfr calculated?","a":"The first steps are formula (ckd-epi 2021, race-free): 142 × (scr/k)^a × 0.9938^age × 1.012 if female, then scr/k = 1 ÷ 0.9 = 1.1111. The calculation in eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) applies the standard Health method, keeping full precision internally and rounding only the final display."},{"q":"What do I need to use the eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021)?","a":"The Serum Creatinine, Age, and Sex that egfr calculator (ckd-epi 2021) asks for, or the page defaults if you just want to see the calculation work. Each input maps directly to the formula, and changing any one of them recalculates the egfr instantly."},{"q":"What does the result from the eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) mean?","a":"The main number egfr calculator (ckd-epi 2021) returns is the egfr for your exact inputs, and the supporting figures and step list give it context. Results from eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) are estimates computed from the values entered; real-world outcomes can differ when fees, taxes, or conditions not modeled here apply."},{"q":"When is the eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) most useful?","a":"Common scenarios for eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021): egfr ckd epi planning, comparing scenarios side by side, and double-checking the egfr. The step list makes it equally useful for learning the method and for double-checking someone else's numbers. Run eGFR Calculator (CKD-EPI 2021) twice with deliberately low and high inputs; the spread tells you how sensitive the egfr is, which a single run never shows."}]},
